[[0,1361739,0,4,0,4,"2016-10-22T02:10:42","zve","",[],"<p>anyone know what the latest remarks are? is he doing any more rallys? any good vids?</p>","what is bernie saying about hillary these days","","whatever"],[1,6625257,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-22T02:29:00","brandon816","[e]",[],"<p>Well, according to one or two leaked e-mails, he apparently sold out to her group. I would expect any remarks that he would make to be for Hillary and against Donald. Haven't heard much from him though. I guess they figure that it would come off as disingenious, and didn't want to chase away any more of his supporters than they already have, so they decided not to push him too much.</p>"],[2,6635700,6625257,0,0,0,"2016-10-23T16:35:21","zve","",[],"<p>could you link the emails?</p>"],[3,6636197,6635700,0,0,0,"2016-10-23T17:41:46","brandon816","[e]",[],"<p>I take back what I had said about absolute evidence. In looking again, the headlines I had read were in response to e-mails that had nothing substantial, and relied on a misinterpretation of an idiom to prove their point.</p>\n<p>I did find something related though. Nothing concrete, but it is still circumstantial evidence. An internal Bernie 2016 memo released in June or July considers requesting free private jet from DNC ( page #4 ) - <a href=\"https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/2997841-End-Game-2016.html\">https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/2997841-End-Game-2016.html</a> . That, along with his compliance so far in supporting Clinton, suggests that he was considering making a deal and likely did.</p>"],[4,6636877,6636197,0,0,0,"2016-10-23T19:19:46","zve","",[],"<p>and whats the source of that doc?</p>"],[5,6636949,6636877,0,0,0,"2016-10-23T19:32:24","brandon816","",[],"<p>The earliest source I can find is Buzzfeed. They don't mention anything about how they got it. Like I said, shaky evidence. <a href=\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/evanmcsan/bernie-sanders-private-plane\">https://www.buzzfeed.com/evanmcsan/bernie-sanders-private-plane</a></p>"],[1,6625808,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-22T03:50:03","gosso920","",[],"<p>&quot;Thank you , Mistress! May I have another?&quot; - Bernie Sanders</p>"]]
